@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 25
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #1D4ED8
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam participantBorderColor #1D4ED8
participant "协调器" as C
participant Source as S
participant "处理任务" as T
database "检查点存储" as K
C -> S : 触发 n
S -> T : 旧记录 → Barrier n
T -> K : 持久化 n 的状态视图
K --> T : 写入成功
T --> C : ACK n
note over C,K #F0FDF4 : 协调器收齐所有必要确认后，检查点 n 才完成
@enduml
